    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="644a7a67-9ac3-5fa3-b249-496592c478ef" activityNameId="fbd154c0-ebf6-5a9b-a3b9-aeb4da7df32e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Glass production site</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glass production site
A production site with a production amount of 3 times 250 t/d (resulting in 266 kt per year) and a total life span of 50 a is assumed here.;
UUID: f922ca45-d058-3023-a86f-d034d697bbea
This module includes the land-use, the material and construction efforts of the machineries (melting furnace, forming machine, cooling furnace), the transport of the furnace to the glass production site and the buildings. Dismantling of the machineries and the buildings are accounted for as well.
Location: european production site, based on personal communication from experts of a European packaging glass producer
Technology: mix of regenerative and recuperative furnace
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f922ca45-d058-3023-a86f-d034d697bbea.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
